  - m_Id: 70513914892290
    m_Localized: Destroy all tentacles to bring down the Kraken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70513914892291
    m_Localized: Strike multiple tentacles at once to deal damage faster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 70513914892292
    m_Localized: The Kraken becomes enraged after taking heavy damage. Stay alert.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6463908430303232
    m_Localized: Dashing grants brief invulnerability. Use it to avoid attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6463908501606400
    m_Localized: "Tentacles take time to recover after a slam. Attack while they\u2019re
      stunned."
